cleared (Event ID 1102) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`). No real-time security alert was generated for log clearance.\n- **Impact**: Allowed the attacker to execute anti-forensic log wiping without immediate SOC intervention.\n\n---\n\n## Baseline Compliance Recommendations\n1. Enforce Network Level Authentication (`UserAuthentication = 1`) on all RDP listeners (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg`).\n2. Implement host-based and network perimeter firewalls to restrict RDP access to authorized internal networks / VPN gateways.\n3. Configure Sysmon or EDR registry modification rules to alert on changes to `CurrentVersion\\Run` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE`).\n4. Configure Windows Event Log forwarding and SIEM alerts for Event ID 1102 (Log Cleared) (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx`).\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
